error[E0576]: invalid static requirement
 --> $DIR/generic.nra:3:28
  |
3 |     static let make = func<U>() -> U;
  |                            ^ a static requirement is not generic
  |
  = note: a static requirement is a plain signature that each implementing class declares
  = help: write it as 'static let make = func(parameters) -> T;'

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0576`.
